Task: Add scenario registry metadata

Summary: Created and registered scenario capability metadata for all scenario types in the capability registry.

Files Changed:
- src/innovate/scenario/registry.py (new)
- tests/unit/test_scenario_registry.py (new)

Details:
- ScenarioCapability dataclass for machine-readable metadata
- Registry maps scenario keys to capabilities
- All 5 scenarios registered: baseline, intervention, substitution, competition, network
- All marked as stable
- All support JSON/Arrow payloads (deterministic serialization)
- All support Python and Rust bindings (polyglot ready)
- Immutable registry using MappingProxyType
- Discovery functions: get_scenario_registry(), get_scenario_capability()
- 10 unit tests covering registry functionality

Why: Establishes the discovery contract for scenarios, enabling tools to introspect scenario capabilities, identify binding compatibility, and validate against payload stability requirements.
